  <data name="Privacy.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Privacy notice</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Intro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Lernkicker is a private learning app for families. It runs on a server at the home of the person who runs Lernkicker and invited you. That person is responsible for the data.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.StoredHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>What is stored</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.StoredParents" xml:space="preserve"><value>Parents: name, email address (for logging in) and an encrypted password.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.StoredChildren" xml:space="preserve"><value>Children: only a first name or nickname, the grade and an encrypted PIN. No date of birth, no photo.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.StoredQuizzes" xml:space="preserve"><value>The uploaded practice tests, which test is assigned to which child, and the results.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.StoredDevices" xml:space="preserve"><value>Which phones are connected to a child (label and time of last use).</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.WhoHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Who sees the data</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Who" xml:space="preserve"><value>Only the parents of a family see that family's children, tests and results. Other families see none of it. The person who runs Lernkicker manages families but does not see other children's results.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.SharingHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>No sharing</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Sharing" xml:space="preserve"><value>There are no ads, no analytics and no external fonts. Data is not passed on to anyone.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.DeletingHeading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Deleting</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Deleting" xml:space="preserve"><value>Parents can delete a child with all results at any time. To delete the whole family, contact the person who runs Lernkicker. Deleted data is gone at once; backups expire after their retention time.</value></data>
